    "Oud-uitwisselingsstudenten": {
      "comment": "What ROTEX is, under its name.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Returned exchange students"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Oud-uitwisselingsstudenten komen graag vertellen over hun ervaringen, om jullie club te informeren of enthousiast te maken. Meer informatie krijgen jullie bij de leden van de MDJC of bij jullie districtsjeugdcommissaris.": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs, host families: where to learn more.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Former exchange students are happy to come and tell your club about their experiences, to inform it or get it enthusiastic. For more information, ask the members of the MDJC or your district youth commissioner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Past dit bij jou?": {
      "comment": "Programmes: heading of who Family to Family suits.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Penningmeester": {
      "comment": "Role: treasurer.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Treasurer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persoonlijke groei en ontwikkeling": {
      "comment": "About tab: a value of Rotary Youth Exchange.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personal growth and development"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persoonlijke groei: uit je comfortzone stappen, zelfstandig worden en je aanpassen aan een nieuwe omgeving": {
      "comment": "About tab: what the programme encourages.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personal growth: stepping out of your comfort zone, becoming independent and adapting to new surroundings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persoonlijke ontwikkeling": {
      "comment": "Programmes: a reason.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Presentielijst DJC-training": {
