            "value": "For every club"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voor de counselor die de student het hele jaar begeleidt.": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs: under the counsellor's documents.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the counsellor who supports the student all year."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voor de gezinnen die de student een deel van het jaar in huis hebben.": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs: under the host family documents.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the families who have the student in their home for part of the year."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voor de jeugdcommissaris van de club die een student uitzendt en ontvangt.": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs: under the youth commissioner's documents.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the youth commissioner of the club that sends and receives a student."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voor een heel schooljaar kost het ontvangen jullie club hooguit € 2.000. De landelijke organisatie MDJC vindt het programma zo belangrijk dat ze elke club die host € 1.250 subsidie geeft. Jullie club betaalt dan hooguit € 750 voor het hele jaar.": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs, costs: the amounts. Keep the amounts exactly.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For a whole school year, hosting costs your club at most € 2,000. The national organisation MDJC finds the programme so important that it gives every hosting club a subsidy of € 1,250. Your club then pays at most € 750 for the whole year."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voor het uitzenden en ontvangen gelden als richtlijn leeftijden van 15½ tot 18½ jaar.": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs, sponsoring: the age guideline.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As a guideline, students sent and received are 15½ to 18½ years old."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voor middelbare scholen": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs: a document's title, information for secondary schools.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For secondary schools"
          }
        }
      }
    },
