      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Waarden": {
      "comment": "About tab: heading.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Values"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waarom Rotary Youth Exchange?": {
      "comment": "Programmes: heading of the reasons to go on a year exchange.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Wat leuk dat jullie als Rotary-club een jaarstudent willen supporten, en daarmee ook een jaar lang een student uit het buitenland in jullie club ontvangen en begeleiden. Misschien heeft een scholier jullie benaderd, of komt de wens van een van jullie clubleden.": {
      "comment": "Rotary clubs: the welcome at the top of the page.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How wonderful that your Rotary club wants to sponsor an exchange student, and so also receive and support a student from abroad in your club for a year. Perhaps a student approached you, or the wish came from one of your members."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wie zijn wij": {
      "comment": "About tab: heading.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Who we are"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zomerkampen": {
      "comment": "About tab: an exchange programme.\nProgrammes: summer camps abroad.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summer camps"
          }
        }
      }
